  "title": "Lavender-Lemon Curd Thumbprint Cookies",
  "description": "Thumbprint cookies at their best! These tender treats combine creamy lemon curd and floral lavender, making the perfect match!",
  "authors": [
    "SunnyDaysNora"
  ],
